DESCRIPTION:Isiah J. Kelly is a nationally touring stand-up comedian and ac
 tor currently on the road with Lavell Crawford. Performing since the age of
  10\, he honed his craft alongside comedians J.J. Williamson and Brandon T.
  Jackson\, with early mentorship from his father and comedy legends Katt Wi
 lliams and Mike Epps.\n\nHis credits include Netflix's Verified Stand-Up\, 
 Coming 2 America\, BET\, Comedy Central\, Showtime at the Apollo\, Who's Go
 t Jokes? (hosted by Bill Bellamy)\, Shaq's All Star Comedy Jam\, Chocolate 
 Sundaes\, and The Tom Joyner Morning Show.\n\nManagement reserves the right
